  <p id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">高宗四十二男：<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p001:m0007" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAA">柳皇后</persName>生<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p001:m0011" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>，<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p001:m0014" ref="ryf_ghj_ryp">彭貴人</persName>生始興王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p001:m0021" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_B">叔陵</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p002:m0000" ref="b13_njz_24q">錢貴妃</persName>生河東王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p002:m0007" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_C">叔獻</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p003:m0000" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>悶絕于地，<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p003:m0007" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAA">皇太后</persName>與<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p003:m0011" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>乳母<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p003:m0015" ref="sfs_3hb_c13">樂安君吳氏</persName>俱以身捍之，獲免。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">河東王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p004:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_C">叔獻</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-liujingyan-children:p004:m0006" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_C">子恭</persName>，高宗第九子也。</p>
</text>
